ot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"AI7\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/AI7.png?fit=683%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/AI7.png?resize=683%2C1024&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-702\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.6670030936656647;width:464px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/AI7.png?resize=683%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 683w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/AI7.png?resize=200%2C300&amp;ssl=1 200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/AI7.png?resize=768%2C1152&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/AI7.png?w=1024&amp;ssl=1 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Overview<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <strong>UKL Piston Valve<\/strong> is a <strong>seatless and glandless valve<\/strong> designed to replace conventional <strong>gate and globe valves<\/strong> with superior sealing and durability. Built with <strong>resilient rings and a stainless-steel piston<\/strong>, it ensures <strong>bubble-tight shutoff<\/strong> equivalent or superior to Class VI leak standards. Ideal for <strong>air, gas, steam, LPG, chemicals, and petrochemicals<\/strong>, this valve is widely used across <strong>power plants, refineries, fertilizers, steel, and process industries<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Seatless and glandless design for leak-proof performance<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stainless steel piston with resilient sealing rings for long service life<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bubble-tight shutoff meeting Class VI leak standards<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Suitable for air, gas, steam, LPG, chemicals, and water applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Size range: 15 NB to 40 NB, with max operating pressure 55 kg\/cm\u00b2 and temperature 427\u00b0C<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>End connections: Screwed (BSP\/BSPT\/NPT), Socket weld, Flanged #150\/#300<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Material options: CF8 \/ CF8M, IBR and Non-IBR compliant<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-20959078 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/contact-us\/\">Send enquiry<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">UNI KLINGER UKL MAKE THERMODYNAMIC STEAM TRAP<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Overview<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <strong>Thermodynamic Steam Trap<\/strong> operates on the principle of velocity differences between steam and condensate, en